    <author>Andrew Mizuno</author>
    <name>W5 Thu - Endurance ride</name>
    <description>IM Cairns plan week 5. Steady Z2 at 67% FTP. Target: Z2 150–175W (62–72%) · HR 130–143 · RPE 3–4. Zwift endurance. 10' WU 120→150W, 35' steady @ 150–175W, cadence 85–95, 5' easy.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
